    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved governance</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Fiji, policy reforms have supported a number of critical accountability and inclusion reforms, namely, the introduction of the new financial management information system, the development and approval of the Financial Handbook for Permanent Secretaries, the approval of the Internal Audit Charter as well as enhanced inclusivity in Fiji&#x2019;s disaster response through the approval of the Disaster Risk Management Bill. These reforms will positively impact the whole of Government</narrative>
    </description>
