    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic policy reform and management and private sector development</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Kiribati, Phase 1 of the new Financial Management Information System will be rolled out in all ministries on Tarawa and Kiritimati Island in July 2024. Implementation of a new payroll system commenced from January 2024. This includes Budget Preparation, Finalisation and Consolidation, Budget Management, Budget Execution and Monitoring, General Ledger, Accounts Payable/receivable, Commitment Management, Cash Management, Accounting and Reporting, Purchase Order Monitoring, Bank Reconciliation and Payroll. Phase 2, covering 3rd party interfaces, and Phase 3, covering Debt and Grant monitoring and Fixed Asset Management, are expected to be rolled out by December 2024, strengthening Government of Kiribati&#x2019;s public financial management capacity.</narrative>
    </description>
